<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Buildcon year net up slightly.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Buildcon year net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		15.29	vs	 15.14</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)     45.5	 vs	 45.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		 231.21	vs	155.03</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  22.0	 vs	 20.29</p>
<p>    Minorities	loss   0.08	vs  gain  0.69</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)   10.0	 vs	 10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Buildcon Bhd. It makes and supplies ready-mixed concrete cement.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
